### Introduction

Finding the right mental health provider can feel complicated when you are also trying to understand your Medicare Advantage coverage. If you have a **HealthSpring Medicare Advantage plan** and are looking for counseling or therapy in Houston, one of the most important questions is whether the provider you choose participates in your plan's network.

For 2026, HealthSpring's Texas and Oklahoma PPO provider directory lists **Manahil Riaz as a Licensed Professional Counselor** among its behavioral health providers. The directory associates Manahil Riaz with a Houston-area practice location and lists behavioral health provider information.

That can be a helpful starting point if you're searching for **HealthSpring Medicare Advantage providers** for mental health care. However, provider directories and insurance benefits can change, and your exact plan determines your coverage and out-of-pocket costs. It is always important to confirm your specific plan and provider before scheduling ongoing care.

## Key Highlights

- HealthSpring Medicare Advantage plans include access to provider networks that can include behavioral health professionals.
